{"i":530,"type":"thought","stage":"pacts","round":1,"phase":"pacts","name":"Eli","text":"Final three locked; a pact costs nothing now and may steer future hazards. Fenn already holds two pacts; Ash is open. I'll offer Ash first."}
{"i":532,"type":"thought","stage":"pacts","round":1,"phase":"pacts","name":"Fenn","text":"I have a pact with Ash, and Eli is the only other living contestant. The jury consists of those who died crossing the bridge, including Dara (my previous partner) and others. If I accept Eli now, I secure an alliance for the final hazard stage. If I refuse or break with Ash, I ri"}
