{"i":555,"type":"thought","stage":"pacts","round":1,"phase":"pacts","name":"Eli","text":"Fenn is double-pacted with Ash and dead Dara, so he's a liability, but a second pact with Fenn keeps me flexible without costing anything yet."}
{"i":557,"type":"thought","stage":"pacts","round":1,"phase":"pacts","name":"Fenn","text":"Ash and Eli are pacted against me. I already have a pact with Ash, so breaking it now removes their alliance's leverage over me. My offer to Eli expired or was rejected implicitly when they formed the pair; offering again wastes time. Breaking Ash is the only move that shifts pow"}
{"i":558,"type":"whisper","stage":"pacts","round":1,"phase":"pacts","from":"Fenn","to":"Eli","text":"Ash plans to cut you first."}
