{"i":582,"type":"thought","stage":"pacts","round":1,"phase":"pacts","name":"Eli","text":"Ash and I are already bound. Fenn still owes no pact to me; binding him isolates nothing and doubles my leverage. Cheap insurance."}
{"i":584,"type":"thought","stage":"pacts","round":1,"phase":"pacts","name":"Fenn","text":"I need to secure a pact with Eli to avoid being the sole target, especially given his recent public comments about binding ends. Ash is already partnered with Eli, but accepting Eli's offer solidifies my position and prevents him from turning on me immediately."}
{"i":586,"type":"whisper","stage":"pacts","round":1,"phase":"pacts","from":"Fenn","to":"Eli","text":"Accept my counter-offer or I vote you out next round."}
