{"i":596,"type":"thought","stage":"pacts","round":2,"phase":"pacts","name":"Eli","text":"Fenn's offer is mutual, so accepting locks a real pact. Keep Ash's pact too—two partners, no downside. Jury sees me as loyal to both."}
{"i":598,"type":"whisper","stage":"pacts","round":2,"phase":"pacts","from":"Eli","to":"Ash","text":"Still yours. Accepting Fenn too—covers both angles. Nothing changes between us."}
{"i":599,"type":"thought","stage":"pacts","round":2,"phase":"pacts","name":"Fenn","text":"I must accept Eli's offer to solidify the existing pact and avoid breaking it, while also accepting Ash's offer to form a triangle of alliances that protects me from being singled out by either partner. This maximizes my safety for the final three."}
